<title>ANGOLA: PRESS DIGEST - Angola - April 29.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Angola - April 29.</headline>
<dateline>LUANDA 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Angolan press on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
<p>JOURNAL DE ANGOLA</p>
<p>- UNAVEM III has announced that the extension of state administration will begin tomorrow in the city of Mbanza Congo, the provincial capital of Zaire province.</p>
<p>- Electricity has been restored to the mining city of Cafunfo in the province of Lunda Norte after an absence of six years.</p>
